          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "BORDER\n\nThis is a very simple yet effective little source that allows the user to create a border around their content. This source is intended to be used as the top layer in a Arena/Avenue composition.\n\nThis example is a very basic introduction into doing math with textures, so even though the patch is simple, there is much to learn."
          }
        },
